cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the checker, cite this software release. Cite the research note separately when relying on its mathematics."
title: "BSC Audit Engine"
type: software
version: 0.3.0-alpha.19
date-released: 2026-07-30
authors:
  - family-names: "Tree"
    given-names: "J."
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A fail-closed structural checker for typed scientific claims,
  authority-typed replay judgments, certificate-interchange defects,
  observation descent, guarded finite-census interval replay, product-valued
  hard gates, atomic-rigidity records, compositional defect bounds, and a
  deterministic repository-backed Custom GPT audit package.
keywords:
  - scientific audit
  - certificate transport
  - chain complexes
  - observation quotients
  - finite census
  - atomic rigidity
  - arithmetic trace
  - adversarial evaluation
  - Custom GPT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jkolantree/octo"
